      "description": "The control sheet that slides down from the top edge over whatever page is showing. 'quick' is one row of toggles, 'levels' a stack of sliders, 'media' the media controls (the OS collapses it while nothing is loaded); 'header' and 'footer' are text rows. Only the plugin that holds the panel role and system.device can supply it; the OS owns the gesture, the sheet and its look. API10 adds the optional update text slot: OS-owned two-line result/notes preview, collapsed when empty. Its tap opens the complete native update page."
    },
